{"id":"wb-8-487","name":"杭州孔庙碑林","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"杭州孔庙碑林","text":"杭州孔庙碑林，由杭州孔庙、杭州碑林两部分构成，坐落于中华人民共和国浙江省杭州市上城区清波街道府学巷8号，沿用南宋以来杭州孔庙府学的地址。杭州孔庙的建筑在清代以后仅存大成殿，1989年在大成殿基础上建成杭州碑林，2008年重建以后碑林与孔庙分离，构成场地东、西两区，目前是浙江省内最大的石刻博物馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%AD%E5%B7%9E%E5%AD%94%E5%BA%99%E7%A2%91%E6%9E%97","revisionId":94659369,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94659369","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7361f321fbc22f42d8d2cafb.jpg","title":"Hangzhou_Kongmiao_20120518-08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hangzhou_Kongmiao_20120518-08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/Hangzhou_Kongmiao_20120518-08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​杭州孔庙大成殿（清代重建），位于中国浙江省杭州市。","width":320,"height":213}}